{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Apee Escapee</strong> is a retro open-world 2D platformer you can play alone or with a friend. Explore one interconnected world where you can go any direction right from the start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find <strong>8 randomly placed skeleton keys</strong> to unlock the cage and <strong>free the Great Apee</strong>. Do <strong>good deeds</strong> to earn karma and open the Good K<strong>arma Door</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, climb on vines, and discover secrets, bananas, gems, and hidden paths as you explore the jungle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udddd\ufe0f <strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open-world exploration:</strong> one interconnected world \u2014 go anywhere, any direction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1\u20132 player local co-op.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random key locations</strong> each playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro aesthetic with CRT vibes.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bananas, gems, secrets, and hidden areas.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Karma Door:</strong> do good deeds to unlock it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free the Great Apee</strong> by finding all 8 keys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4139400/extras/f6306daaae0b1da29891bbebc3ad33df.avif?t=1768211180\" width=459 height=372 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Freed The Great Apee","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4139400/67bb5f3d7244fdc3eb59eedccdd299e8d8b8870e.jpg"},{"name":"Opened good Karma door","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4139400